#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "A Trojan companion of Aeneas, friend of Nisus."
msgstr "En trojansk följeslagare till Aeneas, vän till Nisus."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Eumelus"
msgstr "Eumelus"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "A Trojan companion of Aeneas."
msgstr "En trojansk följeslagare till Aeneas."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Evander"
msgstr "Evander"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Son of Mercury by Carmentis, ally of Aeneas against the Latins, mythical king of Arcadia, founded and ruled Pallanteum, built on the future site of Rome."
msgstr "Son till Merkurius och Carmentis, allierad med Aeneas mot latinerna, mytisk kung av Arkadien, grundade och styrde Pallanteum, som byggdes på den plats där Rom senare skulle ligga."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Herbesus"
msgstr "Herbesus"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "A Rutulian who besieged Aeneas' camp."
msgstr "En Rutulian som belägrade Aeneas läger."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Erulus"
msgstr "Erulus"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Superhuman son of the goddess Feronia."
msgstr "Övermänsklig son till gudinnan Feronia."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Sagaris"
msgstr "Sagaris"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Servant of Aeneas."
msgstr "Aeneas tjänare."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Silvius"
msgstr "Silvius"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Son of Aeneas and Lavinia."
msgstr "Son till Aeneas och Lavinia."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Tereus"
msgstr "Tereus"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "A Trojan, killed by Camilla."
msgstr "En trojan, dödad av Camilla."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Thymber"
msgstr "Thymber"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "A Rutulian, member of Turnus’ army, son of Daucus, twin brother of Larides."
msgstr "En Rutulian, medlem av Turnus armé, son till Daucus, tvillingbror till Larides."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Tiburtus"
msgstr "Tiburtus"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Brother of the twins Catillus and Coras, founder of Tibur to which he gave his name."
msgstr "Bror till tvillingarna Catillus och Coras, grundare av Tibur som han gav sitt namn till."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Tyrrhus"
msgstr "Tyrrhus"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Keeper of the herds for Latinus, father of Silvia."
msgstr "Skötare av hjordarna för Latinus, far till Silvia."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Camilla"
msgstr "Camilla"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "A warrior maiden; ally of Turnus."
msgstr "En krigarjungfru; allierad med Turnus."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Amata"
msgstr "Amata"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Mother of Lavinia (wife of Aeneas)."
msgstr "Mor till Lavinia (Aeneas hustru)."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Anchises"
msgstr "Anchises"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Aeneas' father."
msgstr "Aeneas far."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Adrastus"
msgstr "Adrastus"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "King of Argos, one of the seven against Thebes, and the only one to return alive."
msgstr "Kung av Argos, en av de sju mot Thebe, och den ende som återvände levande."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Aeneas"
msgstr "Aeneas"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Hero of the Aeneid. The son of Anchises and Venus and a member of the royal family of Troy."
msgstr "Hjälte i Aeneiden. Son till Anchises och Venus och medlem av Trojas kungafamilj."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Antenor"
msgstr "Antenor"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Nephew of Priam. He escaped the fall of Troy and reached Italy before Aeneas, where he founded Padua."
msgstr "Brorson till Priamos. Han undkom Trojas fall och nådde Italien före Aeneas, där han grundade Padua."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Oebalus"
msgstr "Oebalus"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "An ally of Turnus, son of Telon and Sebethis."
msgstr "En allierad till Turnus, son till Telon och Sebethis."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Coras"
msgstr "Coras"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Brother of Tiburtus and twin brother of Catillus. He was founder of Tibur and an ally of Turnus against Aeneas."
msgstr "Bror till Tiburtus och tvillingbror till Catillus. Han var grundare av Tibur och allierad med Turnus mot Aeneas."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Alcander"
msgstr "Alcander"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "A Trojan defending Aeneas’ camp against the Rutulians, killed by Turnus."
msgstr "En trojan som försvarade Aeneas läger mot rutulierna, dödad av Turnus."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Assaracus"
msgstr "Assaracus"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Early king of Troy, son of Tros, brother of Ilus and Ganymede."
msgstr "Tidig kung av Troja, son till Tros, bror till Ilus och Ganymedes."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Lamyrus"
msgstr "Lamyrus"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "A Rutulian with the troops besieging the camp of Aeneas."
msgstr "En Rutulian med trupperna som belägrar Aeneas läger."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Butes"
msgstr "Butes"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "A famous boxer who had been defeated by Dares."
msgstr "En berömd boxare som hade besegrats av Dares."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Galaesus"
msgstr "Galaesus"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "An old Italian killed in the first fighting between Latins and Trojans while trying to make peace."
msgstr "En gammal italienare som dödades i de första striderna mellan latinare och trojaner när han försökte sluta fred."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Haemon"
msgstr "Haemon"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "There are two persons in the Aeneid with this name: (a) a Rutulian from a group attacking the Trojan’s camp in the absence of Aeneas, and (b) an Italian whose son, priest of Apollo and Diana, was a soldier of Turnus."
msgstr "Det finns två personer i Aeneiden med detta namn: (a) en Rutulian från en grupp som attackerade trojanernas läger i Aeneas frånvaro, och (b) en italienare vars son, präst för Apollo och Diana, var soldat hos Turnus."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Creusa"
msgstr "Creusa"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Daughter of Priam; first wife of Aeneas."
msgstr "Dotter till Priamos; Aeneas första hustru."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Iasus"
msgstr "Iasus"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "There are two persons in the Aeneid with this name: (a) father of Palinurus, and (b) father of Iapyx."
msgstr "Det finns två personer i Aeneiden med detta namn: (a) far till Palinurus, och (b) far till Iapyx."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Phorbas"
msgstr "Phorbas"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "A Trojan, companion of Aeneas."
msgstr "En trojan, följeslagare till Aeneas."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Salius"
msgstr "Salius"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "There are two persons in the Aeneid with this name: (a) a companion of Aeneas and a contestant in the foot race, and (b) a Rutulian."
msgstr "Det finns två personer i Aeneiden med detta namn: (a) en följeslagare till Aeneas och en deltagare i fotloppet, och (b) en Rutulian."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Caieta"
msgstr "Caieta"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "A nurse of Aeneas."
msgstr "En sköterska till Aeneas."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Cassandra"
msgstr "Cassandra"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Daughter of Priam; she could foretell the future."
msgstr "Dotter till Priamos; hon kunde förutspå framtiden."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Sulmo"
msgstr "Sulmo"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "There are two persons in the Aeneid with this name: (a) a Rutulian in the troop of Volcens, and (b) an Italian whose sons fought for Turnus."
msgstr "Det finns två personer i Aeneiden med detta namn: (a) en Rutulian i Volcens trupp, och (b) en italienare vars söner stred för Turnus."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Catillus"
msgstr "Catillus"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Brother of Tiburtus and twin brother of Coras."
msgstr "Bror till Tiburtus och tvillingbror till Coras."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Telon"
msgstr "Telon"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Ruler of the Teleboans on Capri; father of Oebalus."
msgstr "Härskare över teleboerna på Capri; far till Oebalus."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Volcens"
msgstr "Volcens"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "A Latin, leader of cavalry sent as reinforcements to Turnus."
msgstr "En latinare, ledare för ett kavalleri som skickades som förstärkning till Turnus."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Lausus"
msgstr "Lausus"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Son of Mezentius, killed by Aeneas."
msgstr "Son till Mezentius, dödad av Aeneas."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Dido"
msgstr "Dido"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Tyrian princess who founded Carthage."
msgstr "Tyriansk prinsessa som grundade Kartago."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Ilia"
msgstr "Ilia"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Also known as Rhea Silvia; Mother by Mars of Romulus and Remus, the founders of Rome."
msgstr "Även känd som Rhea Silvia; mor av Mars till Romulus och Remus, Roms grundare."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Halys"
msgstr "Halys"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "A Trojan defending Aeneas' camp against the Rutulian attack. He was killed by Turnus."
msgstr "En trojan som försvarade Aeneas läger mot rutulianernas attack. Han dödades av Turnus."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Italus"
msgstr "Italus"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Ancient hero, eponymous ancestor of the Italians."
msgstr "Forntida hjälte, italienarnas stamfader med samma namn."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Latagus"
msgstr "Latagus"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Soldier of Aeneas."
msgstr "Aeneas soldat."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Magus"
msgstr "Magus"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "A soldier of Turnus, killed by Aeneas."
msgstr "En av Turnus soldater, dödad av Aeneas."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Massicus"
msgstr "Massicus"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "An Etruscan ally of Aeneas."
msgstr "En etruskisk bundsförvant till Aeneas."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Palinurus"
msgstr "Palinurus"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Pilot of Aeneas' fleet."
msgstr "Lots i Aeneas flotta."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Romulus"
msgstr "Romulus"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Mythical founder of Rome in 754 or 753 B.C., son of Mars by Ilia (Rhea Silvia)."
msgstr "Rom grundades enligt myten 754 eller 753 f.Kr. och var son till Mars och Ilia (Rhea Silvia)."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Remus"
msgstr "Remus"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "He and his brother Romulus founded Rome."
msgstr "Han och hans bror Romulus grundade Rom."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Ripheus"
msgstr "Ripheus"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "A Trojan. He fought at the side of Aeneas during Troy's last night."
msgstr "En trojan. Han stred vid Aeneas sida under Trojas sista natt."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Sabinus"
msgstr "Sabinus"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Fabled ancestor of the Sabines."
msgstr "Sabinernas mytomspunna förfader."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Turnus"
msgstr "Turnus"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Rutililan king; Aeneas' rival for hand of Lavinia."
msgstr "Kung av Rutililan; Aeneas rival om Lavinias hand."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Pactolus Catena"
msgstr "Pactolus Catena"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "A Lydian river said to carry gold dust after King Midas washed off his golden touch in its waters."
msgstr "En lydisk flod som sades föra med sig guldstoft efter att kung Midas tvättat av sig sin gyllene touch i dess vatten."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Pantagias Catenae"
msgstr "Pantagias Catenae"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "River of Sicily."
msgstr "Siciliens flod."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Aufidus Catena"
msgstr "Aufidus Catena"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "River in the Apulian territory of Diomedes, now called the Ofanto."
msgstr "Flod i Diomedes apuliska område, numera kallad Ofanto."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Padua Chasmata"
msgstr "Padua Chasmata"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "City in northern Italy founded by Antenor."
msgstr "Stad i norra Italien som grundades av Antenor."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Aurunca Chasmata"
msgstr "Aurunca Chasmata"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "An old town in Campania."
msgstr "En gammal stad i Kampanien."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Drepanum Chasma"
msgstr "Drepanum Chasma"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Coastal town of Sicily where Aeneas found a safe harbor during a raging storm, and where Anchises died."
msgstr "Kuststad på Sicilien där Aeneas fann en säker hamn under en rasande storm och där Anchises dog."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Eurotas Chasmata"
msgstr "Eurotas Chasmata"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "The river on which Sparta stood."
msgstr "Floden som Sparta låg vid."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Larissa Chasma"
msgstr "Larissa Chasma"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "A town in Thessaly, Achilles' native region."
msgstr "En stad i Thessalien, Akilles födelseregion."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Latium Chasma"
msgstr "Latium Chasma"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "The Trojans' promised land in Italy."
msgstr "Trojanernas förlovade land i Italien."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Palatine Chasmata"
msgstr "Palatine Chasmata"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "One of the Seven Hills of Rome."
msgstr "En av Roms sju kullar."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Tibur Chasmata"
msgstr "Tibur Chasmata"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Ancient town of Italy (modern name Tivoli) not far from Rome on the river Anio."
msgstr "Forntida stad i Italien (nuvarande namn Tivoli) inte långt från Rom vid floden Anio."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Janiculum Dorsa"
msgstr "Janiculum Dorsa"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Hill across the Tiber river from Rome."
msgstr "Berg på andra sidan floden Tibern från Rom."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Arpi Fossae"
msgstr "Arpi Fossae"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Town in Apulia (now Puglia, southern Italy) founded after the Trojan war by Diomedes."
msgstr "Stad i Apulien (numera Puglia, södra Italien) som grundades efter trojanska kriget av Diomedes."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Clusium Fossae"
msgstr "Clusium Fossae"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "One of the twelve chief cities of Etruria, situated on the river Clanis."
msgstr "En av de tolv huvudstäderna i Etrurien, belägen vid floden Clanis."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Fidena Fossae"
msgstr "Fidena Fossae"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Town in Latium near Rome."
msgstr "Stad i Latium nära Rom."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Petelia Fossae"
msgstr "Petelia Fossae"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Town of Lucania in southern Italy, founded by Philoctetes."
msgstr "Staden Lucania i södra Italien, grundad av Philoctetes."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Helorus Fossa"
msgstr "Helorus Fossa"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "A river in southeastern Sicily with wide marshes near its mouth."
msgstr "En flod på sydöstra Sicilien med vidsträckta träskmarker nära mynningen."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Himella Fossa"
msgstr "Himella Fossa"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "A river of the Sabines, affluent of the Tiber."
msgstr "En flod i Sabinerna, tillflöde till Tibern."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Argiletum Fossae"
msgstr "Argiletum Fossae"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "A district of Rome near the Forum."
msgstr "En stadsdel i Rom nära Forum."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Carthage Fossae"
msgstr "Karthago Fossae"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "A Punic (Phoenician) city in North Africa."
msgstr "En punisk (fenicisk) stad i Nordafrika."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Gharib"
msgstr "Gharib"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Hero of many tales."
msgstr "Hjälte i många berättelser."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Zaynab"
msgstr "Zaynab"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Daughter of Dalilah in the tale “The Rogueries of Dalilah the Crafty and Her Daughter Zaynab the Coney-Catcher.”"
msgstr "Dotter till Dalilah i berättelsen \"The Rogueries of Dalilah the Crafty and Her Daughter Zaynab the Coney-Catcher\""

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Shahrazad"
msgstr "Shahrazad"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Heroine who tells King Shahryar “The Tales of a Thousand Nights”."
msgstr "Hjältinna som berättar för kung Shahryar \"Tusen och en natts sagor\"."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Ajib"
msgstr "Ajib"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Brother of Gharib in the tale “The History of Gharib and His Brother Ajib.”"
msgstr "Broder till Gharib i berättelsen \"The History of Gharib and His Brother Ajib\""

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Ghanim"
msgstr "Ghanim"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Son of Ayyub, brother of Fitnah in the “Tale of Ghanim Bin Ayyub, the Distraught, the Thrall O’Love.”"
msgstr "Son till Ayyub, bror till Fitnah i \"Berättelsen om Ghanim Bin Ayyub, den förtvivlade, kärlekens träl\""

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Samad"
msgstr "Samad"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Shayk who guides Musa and Talib to the mountains in “The City of Brass”."
msgstr "Shayk som leder Musa och Talib till bergen i \"The City of Brass\"."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Hassan"
msgstr "Hassan"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Character in the tale “Hassan of Bassorah.”"
msgstr "Karaktär i sagan \"Hassan från Bassorah\""

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Al-Mustazi"
msgstr "Al-Mustazi"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Father of benevolent prince Al-Mustansir in “The Hunchback’s Tale.”"
msgstr "Far till den välvillige prinsen Al-Mustansir i \"The Hunchback's Tale\""

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Sindbad"
msgstr "Sindbad"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Voyager who had many marvelous adventures on seven voyages."
msgstr "Voyager som upplevde många underbara äventyr på sju resor."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Sharrkan"
msgstr "Sharrkan"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Son of the great King Omar in “The Tale of King Omar and his Sons.”"
msgstr "Son till den store kung Omar i \"Berättelsen om kung Omar och hans söner\""

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Al-Haddar"
msgstr "Al-Haddar"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "The barber's second brother in “The Hunchback’s Tale.”"
msgstr "Barberarens andre bror i \"The Hunchback's Tale\""

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Shirin"
msgstr "Shirin"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Wife of King Khusrau in the tale “Khusrau and Shirin and the Fisherman.”"
msgstr "Hustru till kung Khusrau i sagan \"Khusrau och Shirin och fiskaren\""

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Al-Fakik"
msgstr "Al-Fakik"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "The barber's third brother in “The Hunchback’s Tale.”"
msgstr "Barberarens tredje bror i \"The Hunchback's Tale\""

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Shakashik"
msgstr "Shakashik"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "The barber's sixth brother in “The Hunchback’s Tale.”"
msgstr "Barberarens sjätte bror i \"The Hunchback's Tale\""

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Ahmad"
msgstr "Ahmad"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Youngest son; brings father a magic apple; marries the Genie Peri Banu."
msgstr "Yngsta sonen; ger fadern ett magiskt äpple; gifter sig med anden Peri Banu."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Aladdin"
msgstr "Aladdin"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Hero of the tale; he has the magic lamp."
msgstr "Sagans hjälte; han har den magiska lampan."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Al-Bakbuk"
msgstr "Al-Bakbuk"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "The barber's first brother in “The Hunchback’s Tale.”"
msgstr "Barberarens första bror i \"The Hunchback's Tale\""

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Al-Kuz"
msgstr "Al-Kuz"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "The barber’s fourth brother in “The Hunchback’s Tale.”"
msgstr "Barberarens fjärde bror i \"The Hunchback's Tale\""

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Aziz"
msgstr "Aziz"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Man betrothed to his cousin Azizah in “The tale of Aziz and Azizah.”"
msgstr "Man förlovad med sin kusin Azizah i \"Sagan om Aziz och Azizah\""

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Bahman"
msgstr "Bahman"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Oldest Prince, brother of Parwez and Perizadah in the tale “The Two Sisters Who Envied Their Cadette.”"
msgstr "Äldsta prinsen, bror till Parwez och Perizadah i sagan \"De två systrarna som avundades sin kadett\""

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Dalilah"
msgstr "Dalilah"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Crafty old crone who fools several men."
msgstr "Slug gammal kärring som lurar flera män."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Ali Baba"
msgstr "Ali Baba"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Hero of tale who found a great treasure owned by 40 thieves."
msgstr "Hjälte i en saga som hittade en stor skatt som ägdes av 40 tjuvar."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Ayyub"
msgstr "Ayyub"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Damascus merchant, father of Ghanim and Fitnah in the “Tale of Ghanim Bin Ayyub, the Distraught, the Thrall O’ Love.”"
msgstr "Köpman från Damaskus, far till Ghanim och Fitnah i \"Berättelsen om Ghanim Bin Ayyub, den förtvivlade, kärlekens träl\""

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Behram"
msgstr "Behram"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Son of a Persian king in the tale “Prince Behram and the Princess Al-Datma.”"
msgstr "Son till en persisk kung i sagan \"Prins Behram och prinsessan Al-Datma\""

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Duban"
msgstr "Duban"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Sage who cured King Yunan of leprosy."
msgstr "Sage som botade kung Yunan från spetälska."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Dunyazad"
msgstr "Dunyazad"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Sister of Shahrazad."
msgstr "Syster till Shahrazad."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Fitnah"
msgstr "Fitnah"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Daughter of Ayyub, sister of Ghanim in the “Tale of Ghanim Bin Ayyub, the Distraught, the Thrall O’ Love.”"
msgstr "Dotter till Ayyub, syster till Ghanim i \"Berättelsen om Ghanim Bin Ayyub, den förtvivlade, kärlekens träl\""

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Harun"
msgstr "Harun"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Harun al-Rashid; Caliph in many tales, for example “Harun Al-Rashid and the Two Slave-Girls.”"
msgstr "Harun al-Rashid; kalif i många berättelser, t.ex. \"Harun al-Rashid och de två slavflickorna\""

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Jansha"
msgstr "Jansha"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Female hero in “The Story of Jansha.”"
msgstr "Kvinnlig hjälte i \"The Story of Jansha\""

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Kasim"
msgstr "Kasim"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "The greedy brother of Ali Baba in the tale “Ali Baba and the Forty Thieves.”"
msgstr "Ali Babas girige bror i sagan \"Ali Baba och de fyrtio tjuvarna\""

