msgstr "I Inferno av Dante stiger Beatrice ner i helvetet för att hitta Vergilius och be honom vägleda Dante. Senare guidar hon Dante genom paradiset i Paradiso."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Inanna Fossa"
msgstr "Inanna Fossa"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Inanna was the Queen of Heaven in ancient Sumerian mythology. She visited the Underworld but was permitted to return in exchange for the life of her husband, Dumuzi."
msgstr "Inanna var himlens drottning i den forntida sumeriska mytologin. Hon besökte underjorden men tilläts återvända i utbyte mot sin make Dumuzis liv."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Dumuzi Fossa"
msgstr "Dumuzi Fossa"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "In ancient Sumerian mythology, Dumuzi was a god of the harvest. He was taken down into the Underworld, but permitted to return to earth for half of each year, resulting in the cycle of the seasons."
msgstr "I den forntida sumeriska mytologin var Dumuzi en skördegud. Han fördes ner till underjorden, men tilläts återvända till jorden under hälften av varje år, vilket resulterade i årstidernas cykel."

