#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Yutu Linea"
msgstr "Yutu Linea"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "A series of Chinese lunar probes, beginning in 2013."
msgstr "En serie kinesiska månsonder med start 2013."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Baret Montes"
msgstr "Baret Montes"

