#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Hyecho Palus"
msgstr "Hyecho Palus"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Korean traveler and scholar, who crossed the Asian continent from China to Arabia and back (724-727), and documented the journey in his journals (704–787)."
msgstr "Koreansk resenär och lärd som korsade den asiatiska kontinenten från Kina till Arabien och tillbaka (724-727) och dokumenterade resan i sina dagböcker (704-787)."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Ranger Planitia"
msgstr "Ranger Planitia"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "A series of US space probes sent to the Moon during 1961-1965. In 1964, Ranger 7 obtained the first close-up images of an extraterrestrial surface."
msgstr "En serie amerikanska rymdsonder som skickades till månen under åren 1961-1965. År 1964 tog Ranger 7 de första närbilderna av en utomjordisk yta."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Lunokhod Planitia"
msgstr "Lunokhod Planitia"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Two Soviet Union planetary rovers that were sent to the surface of the Moon (1970, 1973). Lunokhod 1 was the first remote-controlled, wheeled robot to land on and rove on an extraterrestrial body."
msgstr "Två planetrobotar från Sovjetunionen som skickades till månens yta (1970, 1973). Lunokhod 1 var den första fjärrstyrda, hjulförsedda roboten som landade på och färdades på en utomjordisk kropp."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Sputnik Planitia"
msgstr "Sputnik Planitia"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Soviet Union's Sputnik 1 (literally Satellite 1), the first human-built satellite of the Earth (1957)."
msgstr "Sovjetunionens Sputnik 1 (bokstavligen Satellit 1), den första av människan byggda satelliten på jorden (1957)."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Rosetta Planitia"
msgstr "Rosetta Planitia"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Rosetta mission, the first mission to orbit and land a spacecraft on a comet."
msgstr "Rosetta-uppdraget, det första uppdraget att kretsa kring och landa en rymdfarkost på en komet."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Safronov Regio"
msgstr "Safronov-regionen"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Viktor; Russian astronomer who proposed the planetesimal hypothesis for how the Solar System formed from a disk of gas and dust around the Sun (1917-1999)."
msgstr "Viktor; rysk astronom som lade fram planetesimalhypotesen för hur solsystemet bildades från en skiva av gas och stoft runt solen (1917-1999)."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Belton Regio"
msgstr "Belton Regio"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Michael J. S.; British astronomer who in 2002 chaired the first Planetary Science Decadal Survey, which established NASA’s New Frontiers Program, including the New Horizons mission to Pluto and the Kuiper Belt (1934-2018)."
msgstr "Michael J. S.; brittisk astronom som 2002 ledde den första Planetary Science Decadal Survey, som etablerade NASA:s New Frontiers Program, inklusive New Horizons uppdrag till Pluto och Kuiperbältet (1934-2018)."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Harrington Regio"
msgstr "Harrington Regio"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Robert S.; American astronomer at the US Naval Observatory who is considered the co-discoverer of Charon and was the first to calculate the Pluto system’s mass (1942-1993)."
msgstr "Robert S.; amerikansk astronom vid US Naval Observatory som anses vara medupptäckare av Charon och var den förste att beräkna Plutosystemets massa (1942-1993)."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Sharaf Regio"
msgstr "Sharaf Regio"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Shafika Gil’mievna; Soviet astronomer of Tatar origin, celestial mechanics expert who developed an analytical theory for Pluto’s motion and derived new orbital elements (1915-2002)."
msgstr "Shafika Gil'mievna; sovjetisk astronom av tatariskt ursprung, expert på celest mekanik som utvecklade en analytisk teori för Plutos rörelse och härledde nya banelement (1915-2002)."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Lowell Regio"
msgstr "Lowell Regio"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Percival; American astronomer who in 1906-1916 undertook extensive searches of transneptunian planets (1855-1916)."
msgstr "Percival; amerikansk astronom som 1906-1916 genomförde omfattande sökningar efter transneptunska planeter (1855-1916)."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Tombaugh Regio"
msgstr "Tombaugh Regio"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Clyde William; American astronomer, discoverer of Pluto (1906–1997)."
msgstr "Clyde William; amerikansk astronom, upptäckare av Pluto (1906-1997)."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Piri Rupes"
msgstr "Piri Rupes"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Ahmed Muhiddin, also known as Piri Reis, Ottoman navigator and cartographer (c. 1470–1553). Author of one of the earliest existing world maps in 1513. His “Book of the Sea” (1521), containing 290 maps, was one of the most famous cartographical work"
msgstr "Ahmed Muhiddin, även känd som Piri Reis, osmansk sjöfarare och kartograf (ca 1470-1553). Upphovsman till en av de tidigaste existerande världskartorna 1513. Hans \"Havets bok\" (1521), som innehåller 290 kartor, var ett av de mest berömda kartografiska verken"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Ride Rupes"
msgstr "Ride Rupes"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Sally; American physicist, astronaut, and first American woman in space (1951-2012)."
msgstr "Sally; amerikansk fysiker, astronaut och första amerikanska kvinnan i rymden (1951-2012)."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Venera Terra"
msgstr "Venera Terra"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Series of the Soviet Union’s 16 spacecraft sent to Venus in 1961–1983. The missions accomplished a number of firsts, including the first human made device to enter the atmosphere of another planet (Venera 3, 1966), to measure in situ atmosphere compo"
msgstr "Serie av Sovjetunionens 16 rymdfarkoster som skickades till Venus 1961-1983. Uppdragen innebar ett antal nyheter, bland annat den första människotillverkade anordningen som gick in i atmosfären på en annan planet (Venera 3, 1966), för att mäta atmosfärens sammansättning på plats"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Vega Terra"
msgstr "Vega Terra"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "A pair of the Soviet Union’s Vega 1 and Vega 2 spacecraft launched in 1984 that were the first ones to fly balloons on another planet (Venus, 1985) and then the first ones to image the nucleus of a comet (1P/Halley, 1986)."
msgstr "Ett par av Sovjetunionens rymdfarkoster Vega 1 och Vega 2 sändes upp 1984 och var först med att flyga ballonger på en annan planet (Venus, 1985) och sedan först med att avbilda en kometkärna (1P/Halley, 1986)."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Pioneer Terra"
msgstr "Pionjär Terra"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Early US lunar, planetary, and heliospheric missions including the first to Jupiter and Saturn, 1958-1997."
msgstr "USA:s tidiga mån-, planet- och heliosfärsuppdrag, inklusive de första till Jupiter och Saturnus, 1958-1997."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Voyager Terra"
msgstr "Voyager Terra"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "A pair of US-launched Voyager 1 and Voyager 2 spacecraft that performed the “grand tour” of all four giant planets (1977-1989)."
msgstr "Ett par USA-lanserade rymdfarkoster Voyager 1 och Voyager 2 som genomförde \"grand tour\" till alla fyra jätteplaneterna (1977-1989)."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Viking Terra"
msgstr "Viking Terra"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "US Mars orbiter and landed missions that conducted the first successful explorations of the surface of Mars, 1976 to 1982."
msgstr "Amerikansk Mars-satellit och landningsuppdrag som genomförde de första framgångsrika undersökningarna av Mars yta 1976-1982."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Hayabusa Terra"
msgstr "Hayabusa Terra"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Japanese Hayabusa (literally Peregrine Falcon) spacecraft that performed the first asteroid sample return (2003–2010)."
msgstr "Japanska rymdfarkosten Hayabusa (bokstavligen Peregrine Falcon) som utförde den första asteroidprovreturen (2003-2010)."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Hunahpu Valles"
msgstr "Hunahpu Valles"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "One of the Hero Twins (with Xbalanque) in Mayan mythology, who defeated the lords of the Underworld in a ball game."
msgstr "En av hjältetvillingarna (tillsammans med Xbalanque) i mayaindianernas mytologi, som besegrade underjordens herrar i ett bollspel."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Väinämöinen Vallis"
msgstr "Väinämöinen Vallis"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Väinämöinen is a central character of the Finnish national epic The Kalevala. He traveled to the Underworld to seek knowledge of the dead."
msgstr "Väinämöinen är en centralgestalt i det finska nationaleposet Kalevala. Han reste till underjorden för att söka kunskap om de döda."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Lemminkäinen Vallis"
msgstr "Lemminkäinen Vallis"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Lemminkäinen is a hero of the Finnish national epic The Kalevala. He travels to the Underworld to capture the black swan."
msgstr "Lemminkäinen är en hjälte i det finska nationaleposet Kalevala. Han reser till underjorden för att fånga den svarta svanen."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Pharos"
msgstr "Pharos"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Island where Proteus reigned."
msgstr "Ö där Proteus regerade."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Bogle"
msgstr "Bogle"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Scottish mischievous spirits."
msgstr "Skotska busiga andar."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Butz"
msgstr "Butz"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "German roguish or evil spirits."
msgstr "Tyska skurkaktiga eller onda andar."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Lob"
msgstr "Lob"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "British mischievous spirits."
msgstr "Brittiska busiga andar."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Tore"
msgstr "Tore"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Pygmy lord of the world, creator of all things."
msgstr "Pygméherre över världen, skapare av allting."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Chingaso"
msgstr "Chingaso"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Jivaro (Peru) wife of the creator god Kumpara."
msgstr "Jivaro (Peru) hustru till skaparguden Kumpara."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Dangun"
msgstr "Dangun"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Mythical ancestor of Korean nation, son of creator god."
msgstr "Mytisk förfader till den koreanska nationen, son till skapargud."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Dohitt"
msgstr "Dohitt"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Mosetene (N. Bolivia) creator of the earth and men."
msgstr "Mosetene (N. Bolivia) skapare av jorden och människorna."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Nzame"
msgstr "Nzame"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Fang (Gabon) sky god and creator of all things."
msgstr "Fang (Gabon) himmelsgud och skapare av allting."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Obatala"
msgstr "Obatala"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Yoruba (Nigeria) sky god involved in the work of creation."
msgstr "Yoruba (Nigeria) himmelsgud som är involverad i skapelsearbetet."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Olorun"
msgstr "Olorun"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Yoruba (Nigeria) creator god, gave life to man."
msgstr "Yoruba (Nigeria) skapande gud, gav liv åt människan."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Pachacamac"
msgstr "Pachacamac"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Inca supreme god, “Earth maker.”"
msgstr "Inkas högsta gud, \"Jordmakaren\""

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Pokoh"
msgstr "Pokoh"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Pallawonaps (S. California, USA) deity who made all things."
msgstr "Pallawonaps (S. Kalifornien, USA) gudom som skapade alla ting."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Pouliuli"
msgstr "Pouliuli"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "The first male being in Hawaiian myth, parent (with Powehiwehi) of all the creatures in the ocean."
msgstr "Den första manliga varelsen i hawaiiansk myt, förälder (med Powehiwehi) till alla varelser i havet."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Powehiwehi"
msgstr "Powehiwehi"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "The first female being in Hawaiian myth, parent (with Pouliuli) of all the creatures in the ocean."
msgstr "Den första kvinnliga varelsen i den hawaiianska myten, förälder (med Pouliuli) till alla varelser i havet."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Puntan"
msgstr "Puntan"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Chamorro (Guam Island, Micronesia) pre-existent being from whose body the world was formed."
msgstr "Chamorro (ön Guam, Mikronesien) före-existerande varelse från vars kropp världen bildades."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Samni"
msgstr "Samni"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Kachins (Burma) primeval god, the male element and father of the gods."
msgstr "Kachin (Burma) urtidsgud, det manliga elementet och gudarnas fader."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Seveki"
msgstr "Seveki"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Evenki (Siberia, Russia) creator of the earth and man."
msgstr "Evenki (Sibirien, Ryssland) skapare av jorden och människan."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Shedi"
msgstr "Shedi"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "The first woman, ancestor of human race, co-creator (with her brother and husband Melo) of the earth and sky in the myths of the Minyong (Assam, India)."
msgstr "Den första kvinnan, människosläktets förfader, jordens och himlens medskapare (tillsammans med sin bror och make Melo) i Minyong-myterna (Assam, Indien)."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Tane"
msgstr "Tane"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Tuamotu Islands (Polynesia) creator god."
msgstr "Tuamotuöarna (Polynesien) skapare gud."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Tawa"
msgstr "Tawa"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Hopi (Arizona, USA) sun god who existed at the beginning of creation, father of everything."
msgstr "Hopi (Arizona, USA) solgud som fanns i början av skapelsen, fader till allt."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Tsuki-Yomi"
msgstr "Tsuki-Yomi"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Japanese moon god, born from the right eye of the primeval god Izanagi."
msgstr "Japansk mångud, född ur urtidsguden Izanagis högra öga."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Tuwale"
msgstr "Tuwale"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Ceram (Molucca Islands, Indonesia) sun god and personification of the sky, took part in creation."
msgstr "Ceram (Moluckerna, Indonesien) solgud och personifiering av himlen, deltog i skapelsen."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Wakonda"
msgstr "Wakonda"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Sioux (Great Plains, USA) great creator of all things."
msgstr "Sioux (Great Plains, USA) stor skapare av alla ting."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Wende"
msgstr "Wende"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Mossi (Burkina Faso) supreme god who lives in the sun, creator of the heavens and earth."
msgstr "Mossi (Burkina Faso) högsta gud som lever i solen, skapare av himmel och jord."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Woyengi"
msgstr "Woyengi"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Ijaw (Nigeria) creatrix who made men out of earth."
msgstr "Ijaw (Nigeria) skapare som gjorde människor av jord."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Wulbari"
msgstr "Wulbari"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Krachi (Ghana) primeval sky god, mate of mother earth."
msgstr "Krachi (Ghana) urtida himmelsgud, maka till moder jord."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Xowalaci"
msgstr "Xowalaci"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Joshua (Oregon, USA) creator god."
msgstr "Joshua (Oregon, USA) skapare gud."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Zicum"
msgstr "Zicum"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Assyro/Babylonian primeval goddess from whom came the earth and the heavens, mother of the gods."
msgstr "Assyro/Babylonisk urtidsgudinna från vilken jorden och himlarna kom, gudarnas moder."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Abassi"
msgstr "Abassi"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Efik (Ghana) creator god."
msgstr "Efik (Ghana) skapare gud."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Anguta"
msgstr "Anguta"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Eskimo/Inuit (N. Canada) supreme being who created everything, father of the sea goddess Sedna."
msgstr "Eskimo/Inuit (N. Kanada) högsta väsen som skapade allt, far till havsgudinnan Sedna."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Awonawilona"
msgstr "Awonawilona"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Zuni (New Mexico, USA) primeval deity, supreme life giver."
msgstr "Zuni (New Mexico, USA) urtida gudom, högsta livgivare."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Ambat"
msgstr "Ambat"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Creator of islands from the giant shellfishes in mythology of Malekula Island (New Hebrides/Vanuatu, Melanesia)."
msgstr "Skapare av öar från de gigantiska skaldjuren i mytologin på Malekula Island (Nya Hebriderna/Vanuatu, Melanesien)."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Amma"
msgstr "Amma"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Dogon (Mali) creator of the universe."
msgstr "Dogon (Mali) universums skapare."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Amotken"
msgstr "Amotken"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Salish (NW USA, SW Canada) creator deity, wise and kind old man."
msgstr "Salish (NW USA, SW Kanada) skapargud, vis och snäll gammal man."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Anansi"
msgstr "Anansi"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Spider in Ashanti (Ghana) mythology, who created the sun, moon, stars, and mankind."
msgstr "Spindel i Ashanti (Ghana)-mytologin som skapade solen, månen, stjärnorna och människan."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Atabei"
msgstr "Atabei"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Taino (Puerto Rico) mother goddess, the “First-In-Existence.”"
msgstr "Taino (Puerto Rico) modergudinna, \"den första i tillvaron\""

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Talapas"
msgstr "Talapas"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Coyote, creator of many places and things in Chinook (NW USA) mythology."
msgstr "Coyote, skapare av många platser och saker i Chinooks (NW USA) mytologi."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Dotet"
msgstr "Dotet"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Ket (Yenisey River area, Central Siberia, Russia) god, creator of the northern, down-sloped part of the earth."
msgstr "Ket (Yenisey River-området, Centrala Sibirien, Ryssland) gud, skapare av den norra, nedåtlutande delen av jorden."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Ehecatl"
msgstr "Ehecatl"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Aztec feathered serpent god of wind, one of the creators of the Earth, heavens and humans. His other name is Quetzalcoatl."
msgstr "Aztekernas befjädrade orm, vindgud, en av skaparna av jorden, himlen och människorna. Hans andra namn är Quetzalcoatl."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Enkai"
msgstr "Enkai"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Maasai (Tanzania, Kenya) creator god and the ruler of rains."
msgstr "Maasai (Tanzania, Kenya) skapargud och regnets härskare."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Fuxi"
msgstr "Fuxi"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Chinese god, husband of the goddess Nugua. These two beings were worshipped as the ultimate ancestors of all humankind."
msgstr "Kinesisk gud, make till gudinnan Nugua. Dessa två varelser dyrkades som de yttersta förfäderna till hela mänskligheten."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Glooskap"
msgstr "Glooskap"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Algonquin (Great Lakes area, Canada and USA) creator of plants, animals and humans; son of the Great Earth Mother."
msgstr "Algonquin (Great Lakes-området, Kanada och USA) skapare av växter, djur och människor; son till den stora jordmodern."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Mamaldi"
msgstr "Mamaldi"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Nanai (Amur River area, E. Siberia, Russia) goddess who created the Asian continent and Sakhalin Island. For this action, she was killed by her husband and world creator, Khado."
msgstr "Nanai (Amurflodens område, östra Sibirien, Ryssland) gudinna som skapade den asiatiska kontinenten och ön Sakhalin. För denna handling dödades hon av sin make och världsskapare, Khado."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Kuma"
msgstr "Kuma"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Yaruro (Venezuela) moon goddess, creator of all things."
msgstr "Yaruro (Venezuela) mångudinna, skapare av allting."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Luli"
msgstr "Luli"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Ember-goose who took up some clay from an ocean floor to create a land in Mansi myth (W. Siberia, Russia)."
msgstr "Ember-gåsen som tog upp lite lera från havsbotten för att skapa ett land i Mansi-myten (västra Sibirien, Ryssland)."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Madumda"
msgstr "Madumda"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Pomo (N. California, USA) creator of the universe, brother of Kuksu."
msgstr "Pomo (N. Kalifornien, USA) universums skapare, bror till Kuksu."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Maheo"
msgstr "Maheo"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Cheyenne (Great Plains, USA) Great Spirit, creator of the world."
msgstr "Cheyenne (Great Plains, USA) Den store anden, världens skapare."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Napi"
msgstr "Napi"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Blackfoot (Alberta, Canada/Montana, USA) creator of the earth, animals and mankind."
msgstr "Blackfoot (Alberta, Kanada/Montana, USA) skapare av jorden, djuren och människan."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Nishanu"
msgstr "Nishanu"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Arikara (N. Dakota, USA) creation spirit, great sky chief."
msgstr "Arikara (N. Dakota, USA) skapelseande ande, stor himlahövding."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Fatu"
msgstr "Fatu"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Samoan (Polynesia) male of the first human couple."
msgstr "Samoan (Polynesien) man av det första mänskliga paret."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Gborogboro"
msgstr "Gborogboro"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Lugbara (Uganda) first man, pair to Meme."
msgstr "Lugbara (Uganda) första man, par till Meme."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Gmerti"
msgstr "Gmerti"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Georgian (Caucasus) god, founder and keeper of the world order."
msgstr "Georgisk (kaukasisk) gud, grundare och upprätthållare av världsordningen."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Gucumatz"
msgstr "Gucumatz"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Mayan creator god."
msgstr "Mayaindianernas skapargud."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Huracan"
msgstr "Huracan"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Kiche (Guatemala) creator god, bringer of children, ruler of wind and storms."
msgstr "Kiche (Guatemala) skapargud, barnaföderska, härskare över vind och stormar."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Imberombera"
msgstr "Imberombera"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Kakadu (N. Australia) creator goddess, the Great Mother, mate of the giant Wuraka."
msgstr "Kakadu (N. Australien) skapargudinna, den Stora Modern, maka till jätten Wuraka."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Inktomi"
msgstr "Inktomi"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Dakota (USA) spirit, “The Spider,” created time, space and language."
msgstr "Dakota (USA) ande, \"The Spider\", skapade tid, rum och språk."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Inmar"
msgstr "Inmar"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Udmurtian (Uralic Finns, Russia) creator god."
msgstr "Udmurtian (uraliska finnar, Ryssland) skapargud."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Kuksu"
msgstr "Kuksu"

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Pomo (N. California, USA) deity who created the world with his brother Madumda."
msgstr "Pomo (N. Kalifornien, USA) gudom som skapade världen tillsammans med sin bror Madumda."

#. from yeager:stellarium
msgid "Atum"
msgstr "Atum"

#. from yeager:stellarium
