msgstr " - [#1]: [Feinberg, Richard. (1998). \"Polynesian seafaring and navigation: ocean travel in Anutan culture and society\" The Kent State University Press, Kent, Ohio: ISBN 0-87338-352-4.](https://books.google.ru/books?id=IKgnJ2qkfCQC)\n - [#2]: Rensch, K.H. (1994). \"Fisknamn i västra Polynesien: Futuna, Niue, Samoa, Tokelau, Tonga, Tuvalu, Uvea, Outliers\" Archipelago Press, University of California: ISBN 9780959378771."

