#. from transifex:stellarium-stellarium-po-stellarium-planetary-features-stellarium-planetary-features-pot--master
msgid "Neverland, a fictional island, the destination of Peter Pan and the Darling children in the 1904 play “Peter Pan; or, The Boy Who Wouldn't Grow Up” and the 1911 novel “Peter and Wendy” by Scottish novelist and dramatist J. M. Barrie (1860-1937)."
msgstr "Landet ingenstans (eng. Neverland), en fiktiv ö, Peter Pans och Darling-barnen slutdestination i 1904 års pjäs \"Peter Pan; pojken som inte ville växa upp\" och 1911 års roman \"Peter och Wendy\" skrivna av den skotske författaren och dramatikern J. M. Barrie (1860-1937)."

#. from transifex:stellarium-stellarium-po-stellarium-planetary-features-stellarium-planetary-features-pot--master
msgid "Narmada"
msgstr "Narmada"

#. from transifex:stellarium-stellarium-po-stellarium-planetary-features-stellarium-planetary-features-pot--master
msgid "Narmada River Valley (India), site of Narmada Human, fossil remains of an indeterminate hominin species, the oldest found in India (50,000 – 150,000 BCE)."
msgstr "Narmada River Valley (Indien), platsen för Narmada Human, fossila rester av en oidentifierad homininart, den äldsta som hittats i Indien (50 000 – 150 000 f. Kr.)."

#. from transifex:stellarium-stellarium-po-stellarium-planetary-features-stellarium-planetary-features-pot--master
msgid "Mungo"
msgstr "Mungo"

#. from transifex:stellarium-stellarium-po-stellarium-planetary-features-stellarium-planetary-features-pot--master
msgid "Lake Mungo (New South Wales, Australia) is the site of three significant finds of human including Mungo woman, one of the earliest known cremations."
msgstr "Lake Mungo (New South Wales, Australien) är platsen för tre betydelsefulla fynd av mänskliga kvarlevor, däribland Mungo-kvinnan, en av de tidigaste kända kremeringarna."

#. from transifex:stellarium-stellarium-po-stellarium-planetary-features-stellarium-planetary-features-pot--master
msgid "Windover Collum"
msgstr "Windover Collum"

#. from transifex:stellarium-stellarium-po-stellarium-planetary-features-stellarium-planetary-features-pot--master
msgid "Windover Pond, a site in Florida, USA, yielding remains of 168 individuals (including soft tissue) dating from ~7300 years BP."
msgstr "Windover Pond, en plats i Florida, USA, där man hittat rester av 168 individuella individer (inklusive mjukvävnad) från cirka 7300 år före nutid."

#. from transifex:stellarium-stellarium-po-stellarium-planetary-features-stellarium-planetary-features-pot--master
msgid "Luzia Dorsum"
msgstr "Luzia Dorsum"

#. from transifex:stellarium-stellarium-po-stellarium-planetary-features-stellarium-planetary-features-pot--master
msgid "Luzia Woman, a 11,500 year-old female skeleton found at Lapa Vermelha in Brazil; named as an homage to the Lucy fossil."
msgstr "Luzia Woman, ett 11 500 år gammalt kvinnligt skelett som hittades i Lapa Vermelha i Brasilien; namngivet som en hyllning till Lucy-fossilet."

#. from transifex:stellarium-stellarium-po-stellarium-planetary-features-stellarium-planetary-features-pot--master
