msgstr "Quturjuuk"

#. from transifex:stellarium-stellarium-po-stellarium-skycultures-descriptions-stellarium-skycultures-descriptions-pot--master
msgid "Pituaq, stand containing the burning fuel providing light"
msgstr "Pituaq, stativ som innehåller det brinnande bränslet som ger ljus"

#. from transifex:stellarium-stellarium-po-stellarium-skycultures-descriptions-stellarium-skycultures-descriptions-pot--master
msgid "The big dipper is Tukturjuit, the caribou."
msgstr "Karlavagnen är Tukturjuit, renen."

#. from transifex:stellarium-stellarium-po-stellarium-skycultures-descriptions-stellarium-skycultures-descriptions-pot--master
msgid "Sivulliik, \"the first ones\" , Little Orphan Boy being chased by an angry grandfather."
msgstr "Sivulliik, ”de första”, den lille föräldralöse pojken som jagas av en arg farfar."

#. from transifex:stellarium-stellarium-po-stellarium-skycultures-descriptions-stellarium-skycultures-descriptions-pot--master
msgid "Sakiattiak, The Pleiades, are seen as a breast bone."
msgstr "Sakiattiak, Plejaderna, ses som ett bröstben."

